      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내 요가랑 말인데\n집중력이 너무 부족한 거 있지.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B40020C694AC00B7910020B9D0C778B370000AC9D1C911B825C7740020B108BB340020BD80C871D55C0020AC700020C788C9C0002E00100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래서 전설의 요가 마스터 밑에서\n가르침을 받게 하고 싶어!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798C11C0020C804C124C7580020C694AC000020B9C8C2A4D1300020BC11C5D0C11C000AAC00B974CE68C7440020BC1BAC8C0020D558ACE00020C2F6C5B4002100100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "소문에 의하면, 전설의 요가 마스터는\n5개의 원 중 <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>0시에 해당하는 장소<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>에서<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n수행을 하고 있대.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C18CBB38C5D00020C758D558BA74002C0020C804C124C7580020C694AC000020B9C8C2A4D130B294000A0035AC1CC7580020C6D00020C911002000100002FF0000060030C2DCC5D00020D574B2F9D558B2940020C7A5C18C00100002FF000000C5D0C11C00100001BE00000AC218D589C7440020D558ACE00020C788B300002E00100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "원 안에서도\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>하늘에 가장 가까운 곳<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>에 있다는 모양이야.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6D00020C548C5D0C11CB3C4000A00100002FF000006D558B298C5D00020AC00C7A50020AC00AE4CC6B40020ACF300100002FF000000C5D00020C788B2E4B2940020BAA8C591C774C57C002E00100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "부탁이야! 요가랑을 위해\n전설의 요가 마스터를 찾아 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD80D0C1C774C57C00210020C694AC00B791C7440020C704D574000AC804C124C7580020C694AC000020B9C8C2A4D130B97C0020CC3EC5440020C918002100100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
