      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C804C124C7580020C694AC000020B9C8C2A4D130B294000A0035AC1CC7580020C6D00020C91100200030C2DCC5D00020D574B2F9D558B2940020C7A5C18C0020C548C5D0C11CB3C400100001BE00000AD558B298C5D00020AC00C7A50020AC00AE4CC6B40020ACF3C5D00020C788B300002E00100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
