      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "음? 무슨 일이시죠?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C74C003F0020BB34C2A80020C77CC774C2DCC8E0003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저를 마스터라고 부르는 사람이 있긴 해요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƝ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B97C0020B9C8C2A4D130B77CACE00020BD80B974B2940020C0ACB78CC7740020C788AE340020D574C694002E001000020114019D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래서, 뭘 도와드리면 될까요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƝ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798C11C002C0020BB580020B3C4C640B4DCB9ACBA740020B420AE4CC694003F001000020114019D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제 요가랑이\n오래 집중하질 못해서요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81C0020C694AC00B791C774000AC624B7980020C9D1C911D558C9C80020BABBD574C11CC694002E00100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오래 집중할 수 있게\n밥은 잘 챙겨 먹이고 있는데...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624B7980020C9D1C911D5600020C2180020C788AC8C000ABC25C7400020C7980020CC59ACA80020BA39C774ACE00020C788B294B370002E002E002E00100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그게 문제네요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƝ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8AC8C0020BB38C81CB124C694002E001000020114019D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "요가랑은\n하루에 나무열매 하나만 먹거든요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƝ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C694AC00B791C740000AD558B8E8C5D00020B098BB34C5F4B9E40020D558B098B9CC0020BA39AC70B4E0C694002E001000020114019D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "과식하면 오히려\n몸에 부담을 주게 돼요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƝ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACFCC2DDD558BA740020C624D788B824000ABAB8C5D00020BD80B2F4C7440020C8FCAC8C0020B3FCC694002E001000020114019D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그... 그랬군요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8002E002E002E0020ADF8B7ACAD70C694002E00100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "안심하세요.\n제가 기초부터 가르쳐 드릴 테니까요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƝ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C548C2ECD558C138C694002E000AC81CAC000020AE30CD08BD80D1300020AC00B974CCD00020B4DCB9B40020D14CB2C8AE4CC694002E001000020114019D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "감사합니다!\n역시 전설의 요가 마스터시군요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC10C0ACD569B2C8B2E40021000AC5EDC2DC0020C804C124C7580020C694AC000020B9C8C2A4D130C2DCAD70C694002100100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "가랑!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC00B79100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "요가 마스터를\n찾아 주셔서 감사해요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C694AC000020B9C8C2A4D130B97C000ACC3EC5440020C8FCC154C11C0020AC10C0ACD574C694002100100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "요가랑만큼은 아니어도\n저도 식사량을 조금 줄일까 봐요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C694AC00B791B9CCD07CC7400020C544B2C8C5B4B3C4000AC800B3C40020C2DDC0ACB7C9C7440020C870AE080020C904C77CAE4C0020BD10C694002E00100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0018>",
